  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=854129), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14626681)    \n\nIn a world where pigs exist as a subspecies of humans, Gudam encounters his mother, who has turned into a pig, and continues his daily life with her. What is a pig, and how is it defined? Where does its boundary begin and end? And what defines a human? Gudam endlessly agonizes over these questions while struggling to continue his life with his mother.",
